    <statement><p>A kite <m>50\text{ft}</m> above the ground moves horizontally at a speed of <m>8\text{ft/s}.</m>  At what rate is the angle between the string and the horizontal decreasing when <m>300\text{ft}</m> of string has been let out?</p>
<p>Answer (in radians per second): <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{50}{300^{2}}\cdot 8</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
